[I] Library for queue, tree, I/O and utility functions

[T] libHX is a C library providing data structures such as lists, maps and
[T] bitmaps, string and memory helpers, option parsing, file and directory
[T] operations and other common utility functions. It is used, for example,
[T] by pam_mount.

[U] https://inai.de/projects/libhx/

